    {
        "text": "At first, I treated it as no more than an ordinary job."
    },
    {
        "text": "A small, unremarkable famiglia needed my strength to find their footing in turbulent Siracusa."
    },
    {
        "text": "But with every day that passed, they came to trust me more, even letting me in on important family meetings."
    },
    {
        "text": "I knew it was never part of the contract, but I very much enjoyed the feeling of belonging with these people."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "33_g10_smallrestaurant",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yo, Umiri, my girl! Been a few days since I saw you. How you doing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here, some tangerine cream pudding. If I remember right, that's your flavor of choice, yeah?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#1$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No need, I have my own.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, screw you, be a little grateful!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard you chased off those goons harassing us, all by yourself! Just wanted to show my appreciation!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#9$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Keep your distance from me. I'm just a hired thug doing what I'm paid to. I'll be leaving once I'm done.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "text": "If your boss sees the two of us getting friendly, it won't end well for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It'll be fine. He was telling me earlier, for a while now he's been thinking of inviting you in with us...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#9$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I recommend you ask around Siracusa about my reputation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who needs to ask? You're the strongest person we've ever met!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you ask me, better say yes right now. We'll get together for tonight's family dinner\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#12$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You say it's a family dinner, but it's usually more of a band concert...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, we might not be the strongest famiglia, but you can't beat our sense of camaraderie!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, you joined in the jam session plenty of times. Everyone really gets along with you, y'know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#3$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...We can talk about this when I'm free.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's what you said last time\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#1$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm going now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
