    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "33_g11_mansionhall",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I turned down his kind invitation."
    },
    {
        "text": "But as I walked home, my heart was filled with some nameless emotion."
    },
    {
        "text": "One I have never felt before."
    },
    {
        "text": "That night, I lay on my bed, tossing and turning. I got no sleep at all."
    },
    {
        "text": "Before the sun rose, I had packed all my things\u2014"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$doorknockquite",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#6$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Who would come looking here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_699_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_699_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Umiri. There's been a situation with the boss, and he wants you to take some of the heat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serious Mobster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#7$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I already decided to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_699_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've made arrangements with the prison. They're waiting for you downstairs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serious Mobster"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here's your payment. If you don't think it's enough, we can always add more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serious Mobster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#3$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_699_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Umiri, what's gotten into you today? I say something?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serious Mobster"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is how it's always been, yeah? This is the deal\u2014we pay up, you do the job.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serious Mobster"
    },
    {
        "text": "C'mon, get going. We'll find a way to get your sentence down to six months. That's no time at all. You'll be out before you know it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serious Mobster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
