    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The don's dead, everyone's dead! We had hundreds of people, and now it's just our dozen left!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "text": "We busted our asses moving from Columbia to this stupid place, but you had to go and get everyone killed!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Francis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "33_g2_srcalley",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "What happened in these six months?"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know. The only thing I do know is that\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "Once again, I've lost my 'home'."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
