    },
    {
        "text": "Umiri. You've done a lot for me, at great personal risk to yourself. You've earned a position from me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "I permit you to join my famiglia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#12$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You know I've always been a lone agent. I won't be joining any famiglie.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#12$3",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because you don't want to, or because you can't?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#9$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#9$3",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not like those ruffians who go about calling themselves 'Don', Umiri.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "Over half my life I've been here, wrangling with the big famiglie. They're tricky, they're sly. Never once left this poker table.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#9$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You want me to get you to a table with bigger stakes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#9$3",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Clever girl.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#9$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is separate from making a deal. I need to do a lot more thinking when it comes to joining a famiglia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "text": "The only thing I need to consider in a deal is the money on offer. If I'm going to be part of a famiglia, I need to consider the character of its leader.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#9$3",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kheheh, I know I don't have the best reputation. But that's precisely what we have in common, isn't it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "Umiri. Is anyone willing to take you in, aside from me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#8$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Siracusa's a dangerous place. All you'll find under the banner of Famiglia e Ordine are conspiracies and schemes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "How long since you had a peaceful night's sleep?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lying on your cardboard boxes, dagger in hand in case anyone tries to sneak up on you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "'The lone wolf finally finds a home'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "A return to the pack, a restoration of rank and reputation... or a mutt's death in the wilds, your corpse quartered by hungry beasts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's your choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#8$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_699_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
