    {
        "text": "Sakiko's hands are shackled behind her. She cannot move them an inch."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_699_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "There was another. He managed to run. We're sending boys after him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serious Mobster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know this signorina, Umiri?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#7$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't you recall that we have old debts to settle?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seems she holds something against you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll give you time, I'll give you space, Umiri. You handle this yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4186_tmoris_1#8$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I already said I don't know her...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is your final test before you join my famiglia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "This time... better not try to fake the scene with blood bags.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wizened Voice"
    },
