    },
    {
        "text": "Sakiko and Umiri are left alone in the alleyway."
    },
    {
        "text": "But both know there are people invested in how their duel ends."
    },
    {
        "text": "Umiri knows the boss is watching."
    },
    {
        "text": "Sakiko knows Morpheus is watching too."
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't have anything against you. Why are you trying to get killed?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am here to bring you back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bring me back?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not back to the billiards room, but back to the place you're meant to be.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't understand what you're talking about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even so, I have to pull you out of this. I cannot allow you to throw your life away in this manner.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your boss sent his underlings to stab Francis's people in the back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I hardly believe that the man who stabbed you in the back would grant you the home you wish for.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Umiri Yahata"
    },
    {
        "text": "Exploited like a piece, sacrificed like a pawn, again and again... Is this really the life you want? Is this the trust you so desire?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "text": "In all the time you've spent here, not once have you wanted to hurt a single soul.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just a moment ago, I saw your case inside. Your bass is in there, isn't it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "text": "You never needed to suffer like this, Umiri.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "text": "Umiri... Let's get out of here. Together.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
